  <section><title>Warm Up Activity</title>
<div><figure><media alt="A PICTURE OF A CARNIVAL"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/37663caf58571b86a8917b309c5546b41082f870"/></media></figure></div>
<para>Jada has $20 to spend on games and rides at a carnival. Games cost $1 each and rides are $2 each.</para>
<para>In the following activity, you will complete a series of questions regarding this scenario. </para>
